SUMMARY:Neverness to Everness Version 1.5 Update "Once Upon a Glitched Call" Preview Special Program
DESCRIPTION:Publisher Perfect World Games and developer Hotta Studio will host the free-to-play supernatural urban open-world action RPG Neverness to Everness Version 1.5 Update “Once Upon a Glitched Call” Preview Special Program on October 28 at 4:30 a.m. PT / 7:30 a.m. ET. You will be able to watch it on YouTube (English\, Japanese\, Korean) and Twitch.
URL:https://www.gematsu.com/event/neverness-to-everness-version-1-5-update-once-upon-a-glitched-call-preview-special-program
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.gematsu.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Event_NTE_10-28-26.jpg
