SUMMARY:Honkai: Star Rail Version 4.7 "Now\, Lay Laughter to All Stars" Special Program
DESCRIPTION:miHoYo will host the Honkai: Star Rail Version 4.7 “Now\, Lay Laughter to All Stars” Special Program on October 20 at 4:30 a.m. PT / 7:30 a.m. ET. You will be able to watch it on YouTube (English\, Japanese\, Korean\, Traditional Chinese). \nThe description reads: “In the maddening silence\, a voice said: ‘Laugh\, and let THEM hear your existence.’ And thus\, the stars were silent no more\, pouring all their radiance into a single burst of laughter. Fun lovers of the universe\, put on your masks of utmost elation! Returning from miHoYo\, The Laughter is about to make THEIR live stream debut! What kind of intel will THEY bring us?… Aha’s Night is waiting for you to take the stage!”
URL:https://www.gematsu.com/event/honkai-star-rail-version-4-7-now-lay-laughter-to-all-stars-special-program
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.gematsu.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Event_Honkai-Star-Rail_10-30-26.jpg
END:VEVENT
