SUMMARY:Top Hat Studios Presents: Fall Showcase 2026
DESCRIPTION:Top Hat Studio will host “Top Hat Studios Presents: Fall Showcase 2026” on November 2 at 9:00 a.m. PT / 12:00 p.m. ET. You will be able to watch it on YouTube and Twitch. \nThe broadcast will feature a slate of updates from Top Hat Studios’ catalog\, with new appearances and notable updates\, as well as new game reveals. Viewers can expect premieres\, release window announcements\, demo drops\, platform news\, and additional surprises.
URL:https://www.gematsu.com/event/top-hat-studios-presents-fall-showcase-2026
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.gematsu.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Event_Top-Hat-Studios_11-02-26.jpg
END:VEVENT
